# Swap an exercise in a workout. Start the API with Aspire first, and fill in the IDs from a workout in progress.
@host = http://localhost:5279
@accessToken = paste-an-access-token
@workoutId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@workoutExerciseId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@exerciseId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Swap it → 200 with the workout, or 409 workout.exercise_has_checked_sets.
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/workouts/{{workoutId}}/exercises/{{workoutExerciseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "exerciseId": "{{exerciseId}}"
}

### Undo a swap, with the values the sets had → 200.
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/workouts/{{workoutId}}/exercises/{{workoutExerciseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "exerciseId": "{{exerciseId}}",
  "sets": [{ "weightKg": 80, "reps": 10 }]
}
